---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Projekte & Referenzen | EhrenCode">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
        <header class="mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-secondary uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Referenzen</h2>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">
                Digitale <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-primary to-brand-secondary bg-clip-text text-transparent">Erfolgsgeschichten</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
                Hier siehst du eine Auswahl an Projekten, bei denen ich Vereine auf dem Weg zur modernen Webpräsenz unterstützt habe.
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <!-- BV Brambauer 13/45 e.V. -->
            <div class="group bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-primary transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col">
                <div class="aspect-video bg-slate-950 relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-800/80">
                    <img 
                        src="/images/projekte/bv-brambauer-stadion.webp" 
                        alt="Glückauf-Arena des BV Brambauer 13/45 e.V." 
                        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-40 transition-all duration-700"
                        loading="lazy"
                    />
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900 via-slate-900/40 to-transparent"></div>
                    <img 
                        src="/images/projekte/bv-brambauer-logo.webp" 
                        alt="Vereinswappen des BV Brambauer 13/45 e.V." 
                        class="relative z-10 w-28 h-28 md:w-36 md:h-36 object-contain drop-shadow-[0_12px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
                        loading="lazy"
                    />  
                </div>
                <div class="p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col flex-1 justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-primary/20">Sportverein</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Astro</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Keystatic CMS</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Tailwind CSS</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-secondary transition-colors">BV Brambauer 13/45 e.V.</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                            Kompletter Relaunch der Vereinshomepage für den traditionsreichen Lüner Fußballverein. Modernes, mobiloptimiertes Design mit extrem schnellen Ladezeiten, barrierearmer Navigation, redaktioneller News- und Spielberichtspflege über Keystatic CMS sowie direkter Einbindung von Spielterminen, Clubshop und Aufnahmeantrag.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 gap-4 text-sm font-bold">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white">
                            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span> Live geschaltet
                        </span>
                        <a 
                            href="https://bv-bram.vercel.app/" 
                            target="_blank" 
                            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-brand-secondary hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-secondary rounded-lg px-2 py-1"
                            aria-label="Website des BV Brambauer 13/45 e.V. in neuem Tab öffnen"
                        >
                            Website ansehen
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
                            </svg>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- EhrenCode Initiative -->
            <div class="group bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-primary transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col">
                <div class="aspect-video bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-800/80">
                    <img 
                        src="/favicon.png" 
                        alt="EhrenCode Logo" 
                        class="w-32 h-32 md:w-48 md:h-48 object-contain group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
                        loading="lazy"
                    />  
                </div>
                <div class="p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col flex-1 justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-primary/20">Plattform</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Astro</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">React</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Tailwind CSS</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">EhrenCode</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                            Digitale Pionierarbeit: Aufbau der zentralen Wissens- und Projektplattform unter Einsatz modernster Web-Technologien. Durch die Kombination von praxiserprobtem Know-how und barrierefreien Komponenten entsteht eine transparente Anlaufstelle für Vereine im digitalen Wandel.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span> Live geschaltet
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Dein Verein Banner -->
            <div class="group md:col-span-2 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900/60 via-slate-900/30 to-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 border-dashed rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 text-center md:text-left hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-6">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-brand-primary/10 border border-brand-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl text-brand-primary shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        🤝
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Dein Verein braucht auch Unterstützung?</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm md:text-base max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
                            Ich unterstütze gemeinnützige Vereine ehrenamtlich und kostenfrei bei der Modernisierung ihrer Webpräsenz. Lass uns sprechen!
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <a 
                    href="/#kontakt" 
                    class="shrink-0 bg-brand-primary hover:bg-brand-primary/90 text-white font-bold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl text-sm transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-lg shadow-brand-primary/20 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-primary"
                >
                    Projekt anfragen →
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="mt-32 p-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/50 to-transparent border-t border-slate-800 rounded-t-[3rem] text-center">
            <h2 class="text-slate-500 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">Eingesetzte Technologien</h2>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 opacity-50 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700">
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Gemini</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Astro</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Keystatic CMS</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Tailwind CSS</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Vercel</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">GitHub</span>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</MainLayout>